{"channelId":"UCFNm26OW87Dm3fZ1txX1vGA","row":["UCD - University College Dublin",53400,"Thanks for watching. Please subscribe.\n\nThis channel gives viewers a sense of campus life at University College Dublin, Ireland's global university.\n\nUCD first opened its doors in 1854. Today, over 24,000 students from 120 countries study at the university. \n \nJames Joyce, the author of Ulysses, completed his BA at the university in 1902.\n\nOther well-known graduates include the author Flann O'Brien, the actors Gabriel Byrne and Brendan Gleeson, film directors Neil Jordan and Jim Sheridan, and former Irish rugby captain Brian O'Driscoll. Numerous Irish Presidents and Taoisigh (Prime Ministers) also studied at UCD including: John Bruton (Prime Minister), John A Costello (Prime Minister), Dr Garret Fitzgerald (Prime Minister), and Cearbhall Ó Dálaigh (President).\n \nCredits: Editorial Direction, Dominic Martella | Content Production & Development, Andrew Fogarty.","","Ireland"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFNm26OW87Dm3fZ1txX1vGA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFNm26OW87Dm3fZ1txX1vGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:43.894Z","channelId":"UCFNm26OW87Dm3fZ1txX1vGA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"f9a815bfe86a7712c0d7f4b24b6e7cd95c86f32632310b3749b4463987b729ba","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"dd542d0143f6b2f29322641c64c151f19a0368742423065f1d23995487940141"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFNm26OW87Dm3fZ1txX1vGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:43.894Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFNm26OW87Dm3fZ1txX1vGA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":53400,"raw":"53.4K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCFNm26OW87Dm3fZ1txX1vGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:43.894Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality"